config BR2_PACKAGE_LUCKFOX_FIRMWARE
	bool "Luckfox Firmware Package"
	help
	  Downloads and installs firmware files from Luckfox repository
	  during the build process.
	  
	  This package provides:
	  - WiFi firmware for AIC8800DC
	  - MCU firmware for RV1106
	  - U-Boot binaries and configuration
	  - Kernel modules and drivers
	  
	  The firmware is automatically downloaded from the official
	  Luckfox repository during build, ensuring the latest versions
	  are always used.
